    <string name="help_text">How it works: the app registers a system network callback (event driven, no polling and no wake locks). It is woken once when Wi-Fi connects or disconnects and then uses the external control interface of the selected client (CMFA: START_CLASH / STOP_CLASH, FlClash: START / STOP). No intent is sent when the state does not change, so battery usage stays minimal.</string>
